{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も一日お疲れちま(*´˘`*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも、コメントありがとうございます(っ´ω`c)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メールのお返事も、こちらのコメントで読めるから嬉しいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学期末テスト昨日で終わりました～♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日中にブログあげたかったのですが、終わってからすぐ収録に向かったので、今日になっちゃった(   ´･ω･`   )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テスト1週間前と制作期間がかぶってしまっていたから、けっこう辛くて睡魔と戦いながら対策のお勉強してたけど..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今出せる力を出し切って、頑張りました！(,,> <,,)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は学校がお休みだったので、朝は久しぶりにゆっくり眠れたよ*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お昼頃は渋谷と原宿をお散歩(´๑•ω•๑`)☆*:.｡."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、18時からは「季刊乃木坂vol.1早春」発売記念商品お渡し会でした＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒い中来て下さったみなさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました(*´︶`*)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少しの時間でしたが、お話もできて楽しかったです♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーそれぞれの、自然な表情が見られると思います＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひ、いっぱ～い見て下さいね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日奈の写真からは沢山の癒しビームを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"放っているつもりなんだけど...感じるかなぁ？笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなさんに元気になってもらいたい♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(*ૣᵕ꒳̮ᵕ ૣ*)ﾟ+｡:.ﾟஐ⋆*♡･:*ೄ‧͙·*♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2014/03/07/9960458/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑オフショット☆*:.｡."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来られなかったひなちまふぁみりーさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は、2つ結びのゆる巻きツインで、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"れいかときいちゃんと一緒のレーンでしたよん♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2014/03/07/9960458/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「季刊乃木坂vol.1早春」ぜひ見てほしいなぁ(´,,•ω•,,｀)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてそしてっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"8thシングル「気づいたら片想い」のミュージックビデオが公開されました＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"強がっていながらも寂しさが溢れる歌詞に、片想いの女の子の気持ちが表れていて、男性にも女性にも聴いて頂きたい曲です...*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また、切ないストーリーに涙が零れます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2014/03/07/9960458/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなちまふぁみりーさんっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミュージックビデオに映る日奈を探してね...(´,,•ω•,,｀)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに最初の屋上にいるなーちゃんを、いこまちゃんと日奈が声を出して呼んでいるので、ぜひ注目して頂きたいです♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レッスンの風景では、前髪も後ろ髪も全部アップの髪型です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2014/03/07/9960458/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"滅多におでこ出さないから、少し恥ずかしかったよぉ(｡•́ω•̀｡)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は学校！頑張ります☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また、寒さが戻ってきたみたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな、風邪ひかないでね(*˘︶˘*).｡.:*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【3月3日おがさん】\n【3月3日りっきーさん】\n【3月3日まいさん】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【3月6日paulさん】\n【3月6日はんちゃんさん】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【3月7日あやなさん】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【3月8日NICO⊿さん】\n【3月8日いち.に.さん】\n【3月8日タケヤマさん】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【3月9日いっちぃさん】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"☆HAPPY BIRTHDAY☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵な一年になります様に .｡.:*☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日もみなさんにとって幸せであります様に♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好き"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日奈"}],"source":"archive"}